{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build the coziest village</h2><br>In <strong>Frisia</strong> you start on an uninhabited Northsea island and are tasked with building a functional, yet cozy and beautiful little town. Inspired by the frisian architecture of the Dutch and German Northsea coast, <strong>Frisia</strong> aims to create a cozy gameplay experience in harmony with simple town-building and strategy game mechanics!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Construct a village for your villagers to live and work!<br></li><li>Beautify your village with cosmetic objects and nature elements and customize buildings to suit your personal taste<br></li><li>Work in harmony with the tides as the flood swallows the land regularly but also leaves behind valuable resources<br></li><li>Manage production chains to keep your villagers happy and produce the necessary goods for your growing village</li></ul><br>You have fantasized about life in a picturesque little village by the sea? In <strong>Frisia</strong> you can let your imagination run free and create the coziest frisian village you could possibly think of!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2578430?t=1742390341","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742390341","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578430/c646d999c029299dea386a985e5dfa6d262cf5fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742390341","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578430/c646d999c029299dea386a985e5dfa6d262cf5fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742390341","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2756500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build the coziest village</h2><br>In <strong>Frisia</strong> you start on an uninhabited Northsea island and are tasked with building a functional, yet cozy and beautiful little town. Inspired by the frisian architecture of the Dutch and German Northsea coast, <strong>Frisia</strong> aims to create a cozy gameplay experience in harmony with simple town-building and strategy game mechanics!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Construct a village for your villagers to live and work!<br></li><li>Beautify your village with cosmetic objects and nature elements and customize buildings to suit your personal taste<br></li><li>Work in harmony with the tides as the flood swallows the land regularly but also leaves behind valuable resources<br></li><li>Manage production chains to keep your villagers happy and produce the necessary goods for your growing village</li></ul><br>You have fantasized about life in a picturesque little village by the sea? In <strong>Frisia</strong> you can let your imagination run free and create the coziest frisian village you could possibly think of!","developers":["Rouven Cabanis","Wetterfest"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578430/header.jpg?t=1742390341","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116308,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116308/movie480.mp4?t=1742389568","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116308/movie_max.mp4?t=1742389568"},"name":"Frisia - Tales & Tides","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116308/e5b0986e8523ee3f5a70b5f328836fbfa75e42f6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742389568","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116308/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742389568","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116308/movie_max_vp9.we